{
  "info": {
    "name": "Home-Care Central API (Phase 1 + Milestone 2)",
    "description": "1) Run backend: npm run dev. 2) Folder 0: login as the role you need (cookies are kept automatically; log in again to switch role). 3) IDs (applicantId, caregiverId, clientId, visitId, docId, certId) are filled in automatically by the 'List'/'Create' requests - run those first. Suggested order: Public apply -> login HR -> List applicants -> Applicant detail -> move stages (screening, interview, offer) -> HIRE -> read the set-password link from the email (or the backend console) -> Set password -> login Staff. Then login Admin -> Create client -> Create care plan -> Create visit -> login Staff -> My visits -> Add note -> Mark completed -> login Client -> My visits / My care plan.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
